# ROOFCAT: falling off the bottom costs a life. Pepper's spirit floats down
# from the top of the screen, flies anywhere, can't be hurt and shoots twin
# shots (slower than stars). A brings her back at once, where the spirit is,
# and with no grace period.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 340
cheat put 95 83
wait 40
expect lives == 2
expect spirit == 1
expect killer == 2000
expect py < 10
wait 40
expect py > 0
# the spirit flies through foes unharmed
cheat foe pigeon 90 60
hold UP 10
expect spirit == 1
# twin shots: two at a time, and no stars
hold B 3
expect spirit_shots == 2
expect stars == 0
hold B 12
expect spirit_shots == 2
hold B 12
expect spirit_shots == 4
hold RIGHT 20
# A: back to life right here
press A 1
expect spirit == 0
expect lives == 2
# no grace period: a foe on top of her takes the next life at once
cheat put 150 83
cheat foe pigeon 150 80
wait 2
expect spirit == 1
expect lives == 1
